  "title": "Italian Chicken with Pesto Potatoes",
  "description": "Filling the pockets of each chicken breast with mozzarella guarantees that the chicken itself is beautifully tender. The chicken can be prepared in advance and then baked at the last minute.",
  "authors": [
    "Paula Fitzgerald"
  ],
